WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.264 --> 00:00:04.935
TONIGHT CORRESPONDENT TALKS

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:07.071
ABOUT THE BAD TIMING FOR THOSE

00:00:05.069 --> 00:00:09.173
OF YOU DRIVING DURING SUMMER

00:00:07.204 --> 00:00:11.408
VACATION.

00:00:09.306 --> 00:00:12.543
&gt;&gt; IT IS HARD NOT TO NOTICE,

00:00:11.542 --> 00:00:12.843
EVEN WHEN YOU CANNOT BEAR TO

00:00:12.676 --> 00:00:14.745
LOOK.

00:00:12.976 --> 00:00:19.149
&gt;&gt; I'M SCARED TO DEATH, BECAUSE

00:00:14.878 --> 00:00:20.818
I GET PENNED ON THAT EXTRA MONEY

00:00:19.283 --> 00:00:22.286
FOR MY CAR AND GROCERIES AND

00:00:20.951 --> 00:00:24.988
THINGS LIKE THAT.

00:00:22.419 --> 00:00:26.990
&gt;&gt; GIESE PRESSES ON THE RISE,

00:00:25.122 --> 00:00:28.392
THE CRUNCH FOR COMMUTERS THAT

00:00:27.124 --> 00:00:30.928
STRETCHES THE FAMILY BUDGET.

00:00:28.525 --> 00:00:33.397
&gt;&gt; WHEN I STARTED GAS WAS $2.20

00:00:31.061 --> 00:00:34.832
PER GALLON, NOW IT IS UP TO $3

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:36.400
PER GALLON DEPENDING ON WHERE

00:00:34.965 --> 00:00:36.800
YOU SHOP, THAT MAKES A BIG

00:00:36.533 --> 00:00:38.669
DIFFERENCE.

00:00:36.934 --> 00:00:39.403
&gt;&gt; THE USUAL TALK OF THE SUMMER

00:00:38.802 --> 00:00:41.905
DRIVING SEASON BEING THE REASON

00:00:39.536 --> 00:00:44.041
FOR THE RISE IS OUT THERE, BUT

00:00:42.039 --> 00:00:45.442
EXPERTS SAY THERE IS MORE AT

00:00:44.174 --> 00:00:45.976
WORK HERE THAN JUST THE

00:00:45.576 --> 00:00:47.811
CALENDAR.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:49.580
CONCERNS ABOUT THE IRAN NUCLEAR

00:00:47.945 --> 00:00:52.182
DEAL FALLOUT FOR ONE.

00:00:49.713 --> 00:00:54.218
WHICH SOME SPECULATE COULD TREND

00:00:52.316 --> 00:00:57.154
GLOBAL SUPPLIES.

00:00:54.351 --> 00:00:59.456
CONSIDER OILS PLUNGED FROM $100

00:00:57.287 --> 00:01:00.958
A BARREL TO JUST BELOW $30 A

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:02.459
BARREL IN 2016.

00:01:01.091 --> 00:01:04.361
AND ACCORDINGLY PRICES FELL, BUT

00:01:02.593 --> 00:01:07.197
SINCE THEN THEY HAVE BEEN ON THE

00:01:04.495 --> 00:01:09.032
RISE WITH WEST TEXAS CRUDE, THE

00:01:07.331 --> 00:01:10.601
U.S. BENCHMARK TOPPING $71 A

00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:12.770
BARREL.

00:01:10.734 --> 00:01:13.837
AS IT IS UP 14% FROM THE

00:01:12.903 --> 00:01:16.173
BEGINNING OF THE YEAR.

00:01:13.971 --> 00:01:18.976
AND MORE PAYING AT THE PUMP WITH

00:01:16.306 --> 00:01:21.478
THEIR NATIONAL PRICE PER GALLON

00:01:19.109 --> 00:01:23.247
AVERAGING $2.84, UP $0.19 OVER

00:01:21.612 --> 00:01:25.682
LAST MONTH AND $0.51 HIGHER THAN

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:27.785
THIS TIME LAST YEAR.

00:01:25.816 --> 00:01:28.986
EXPERTS SAY THAT IS IN PART

00:01:27.918 --> 00:01:29.987
BECAUSE WALL STREET TRADERS

00:01:29.119 --> 00:01:32.222
ANTICIPATED THE PRESIDENT'S

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:32.523
DECISION TO PULL OUT OF THE IRAN

00:01:32.356 --> 00:01:34.057
DEAL.

00:01:32.656 --> 00:01:35.859
&gt;&gt; THE MARKET WAS PREPARED FOR

00:01:34.191 --> 00:01:37.394
THE U.S. TO PULL OUT, A CAMPAIGN

00:01:35.993 --> 00:01:38.896
PROMISE THAT HE HAS BEEN KNOWN

00:01:37.528 --> 00:01:40.631
TO DO WHATEVER HE CAN IN HIS

00:01:39.029 --> 00:01:42.966
POWER WHETHER GOOD OR BAD FOR

00:01:40.764 --> 00:01:43.534
THE PRESENT SITUATION TO KEEP

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:46.036
THE CAMPAIGN PROMISES.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:47.538
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT HAS ALSO

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:49.306
PROMISED TO RETALIATE AGAINST

00:01:47.671 --> 00:01:49.807
THOSE WHO MANIPULATE THE PRICE

00:01:49.439 --> 00:01:51.608
OF OIL.

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:53.043
TWEETING THAT IT LOOKS LIKE OPEC

00:01:51.742 --> 00:01:54.678
IS ADDED AGAIN.

00:01:53.177 --> 00:01:55.212
OIL PRICES ARE ARTIFICIALLY VERY

00:01:54.812 --> 00:01:56.113
HIGH.

00:01:55.345 --> 00:01:58.448
NO GOOD.

00:01:56.246 --> 00:02:00.417
AND WILL NOT BE ACCEPTED.

00:01:58.582 --> 00:02:01.385
&gt;&gt; EXPERTS ARGUE THAT FRANKLY

00:02:00.551 --> 00:02:03.086
NOT MUCH OF THAT THE PRESIDENT

00:02:01.518 --> 00:02:04.922
CAN DO ABOUT THE PROBLEM SHORT

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:05.455
OF TAPPING THE NATION'S

00:02:05.055 --> 00:02:07.124
STRATEGIC RESERVES.

00:02:05.589 --> 00:02:08.559
THAT IS A MOVE THAT THEY SAY

